    "section_text_43WLdz": {
      "type": "section-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_bAQ6CF": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A New Standard in Dog Beds: The Half-Bolster Design with More Space and Softer Support</p>",
            "size": 100,
            "heading_highlight_type": "italics",
            "highlight_color": "#d43747",
            "highlight_text_color": "#000000"
          }
        },
        "text_rPJfNH": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We’ve engineered the Cloud Bed with a half-bolster pillow to provide dogs with the best of both worlds: a softer memory foam bolster that gently cradles their heads without being overly firm or tall. This open, half-bolster design maximises mattress space, allowing dogs to stretch out naturally - unlike traditional full-bolster beds. The low-profile orthopaedic mattress makes it easy for smaller dogs to climb in, while adding a sleek, minimalist touch to your home.</p>",
            "size": 100
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_bAQ6CF",
        "text_rPJfNH"
      ],
