      "blocks": {
        "template--18952594129217__38ff978b-66eb-4318-9ce0-94db8ff86311-1683126238ada0cf52-0": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Cloud_Bed_-_Sleep_Cloud-2.jpg",
            "title": "Soft Memory Foam Pillow and Half Bolster Bed Design",
            "text": "<p>Unlike traditional firm, high-bolster beds, our bed is designed with a lower, softer memory foam bolster. This thoughtful construction reduces neck strain for smaller dogs, while the half-bolster bed design maximises mattress space, allowing dogs to stretch out naturally and enjoy the utmost comfort.</p>",
