          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Koozi_logo-blue_linen.jpg",
            "title": "Premium Upholstery Linen and Boucle Fabrics",
            "text": "<p>We carefully choose fabrics that combine timeless style, durability, and ease of care. Our linen cover range offers natural, earthy tones that will blend effortlessly with your home, while our boucle fabric cover  provides a soft, cosy feel in a buttery warm colour.</p>",
