            "text": "<p>The low-profile mattress design allows small and medium dogs to easily hop on and off the bed, providing accessibility that traditional bolster beds often lack due to their thick, high profiles. Unlike other beds with full bolsters, our design ensures your pet can comfortably settle in without straining their legs.</p>",
