      "blocks": {
        "text_i9wcWL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is included in the New York Marble Bowl Set?",
            "text": "<p>Included in the set are two generously sized marble bowls and a large marble tray. The tray features a non-slip and anti-scratch base. </p>"
          }
        },
        "text_7BUPHw": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is New York Marble?",
            "text": "<p>New York Marble, or sometimes referred to as Milas Lilac Marble, is sourced from the southern coastal region of Milas / Bodrum in Turkey. Known for its white and lilac hues with striking purple veining, this marble is an ideal choice for pet parents who appreciate premium interior finishes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_zNfNWV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is marble safe for dogs?",
            "text": "<p>Natural marble stone is safe for dog use. It is non-toxic and non-porous, which helps reduce bacterial growth.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_QpHdH6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the capacity of each bowl?",
            "text": "<p>Each bowl has a 900ML capacity, which is suitable for both small and large dogs and cats.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_rqHJX8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Warranty and returns",
            "text": "<p><strong>Returns</strong><br/>The Marble Bowl Tray is a limited edition piece and sale is final. It cannot be returned or exchanged for change of mind.<br/><br/><strong>Warranty<br/></strong>Warranty is offered for manufacturing defects including faulty workmanship or materials. This warranty does not cover normal wear and tear or damages caused by the customer or by dog use, such as excessive scratching, biting, accidents, chewing, or other use.</p><p>For warranty issues, please contact us within 48 hours of opening the bed at <a>hello@koozipets.com.au</a>, including images of the defective or damaged item. Failure to provide this information within the specified timeframe may void your exchange or refund.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_4nMzGk": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I clean the bowls?",
            "text": "<p>As the bowl set is 100% natural marble, we recommend hand wash with warm water and mild detergent. With a smooth surface, it wipes away dirt and cleans easily.</p><p>Clean the tray with mild spray and wipe. </p>"
          }
        }
      },
